{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/MasterYourWeapon.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are dozens of weapons that you'll need to master to survive in combat.\u00a0 Each weapon comes with their own unique move list and mechanics.\u00a0 Throw and recall the giant Great Sword to extend combos, gain armor with the Warhammer, or teleport for quick counter-hits with the Light Dagger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/FullDaggerComboFinal.gif?t=1746227301\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/LootEverything.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge the land to find valuable loot and gear.\u00a0 You'll need this items for quests, crafting, and to sell on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/Loot_Gif.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ExtractSafely.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've gathered your loot you'll need to extract from the map.\u00a0 Be careful though, if you die on the map you'll lose everything you found!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/Extract_Gif.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/BuildYourBase.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your home base is upgradable to your liking.\u00a0 This will unlock new weapons, stronger armor and helmets, and increase your characters stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/BaseBuilding.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/EliminateBoutnies.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering your weapon, finding loot, extracting, and upgrading your base leads to one goal.\u00a0 Take out the gangs ruling the city and become the best bounty hunter in Nexus-8!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/HuntBounties.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3366750?t=1746227301","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3366750?t=1746227301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/9b03e2381715ef5a8c6f5cd2572aa0a481a6a553/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746227301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/9b03e2381715ef5a8c6f5cd2572aa0a481a6a553/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746227301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/MasterYourWeapon.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are dozens of weapons that you'll need to master to survive in combat.\u00a0 Each weapon comes with their own unique move list and mechanics.\u00a0 Throw and recall the giant Great Sword to extend combos, gain armor with the Warhammer, or teleport for quick counter-hits with the Light Dagger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/FullDaggerComboFinal.gif?t=1746227301\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/LootEverything.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge the land to find valuable loot and gear.\u00a0 You'll need this items for quests, crafting, and to sell on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/Loot_Gif.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ExtractSafely.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've gathered your loot you'll need to extract from the map.\u00a0 Be careful though, if you die on the map you'll lose everything you found!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/Extract_Gif.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/BuildYourBase.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your home base is upgradable to your liking.\u00a0 This will unlock new weapons, stronger armor and helmets, and increase your characters stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/BaseBuilding.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/EliminateBoutnies.png?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastering your weapon, finding loot, extracting, and upgrading your base leads to one goal.\u00a0 Take out the gangs ruling the city and become the best bounty hunter in Nexus-8!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/HuntBounties.gif?t=1746227301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["CourtesyOfEndo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/e955a70b6a5d079c437a5cb224014c05a2f67ca4/header.jpg?t=1746227301","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131401,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131401/movie480.mp4?t=1746227299","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131401/movie_max.mp4?t=1746227299"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131401/e79d1b2c00b474289fb606d6e64f1774e37c166f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746227299","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131401/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746227299","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131401/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746227299"}}],"name":"Echo Extract","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS/Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"